      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.direct, '', [
        'Yes, leg cramps, sudden, painful tightening usually in the calf, are common in the second and third trimesters, affecting up to about 3 in 10 pregnant women. They\'re uncomfortable but usually harmless, and several simple habits can genuinely help.',
      ], []),
