        'Resting with your feet up, lying on your left side, and wearing loose clothing around your ankles can genuinely help with ordinary swelling. What\'s worth flagging specifically is swelling that appears suddenly, swelling in your hands or face, or one-sided leg swelling with warmth or redness, since these patterns point elsewhere.',
